    "primary_gate": "Primary inference uses the fixed old7_band robustness, not the mechanically more extreme applicable-limit post events. A credible widening effect requires the daily event-minus-control next-day abs-return premium and the cross-sectional event_post interaction to pass Harvey |t|>3 in the same direction.",
